message: "If you use ClosureProbe, please cite this software."
title: "ClosureProbe: Executable Conformance for Negative-Evidence Integrity in Agentic Toolchains"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Moon
repository-code: "https://github.com/risu-research/closureprobe"
url: "https://github.com/risu-research/closureprobe"
version: 0.1.0-rc1
date-released: 2026-08-14
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  ClosureProbe tests whether query-relative closure signals survive API,
  adapter, protocol, client, and model-facing boundaries without silently
  upgrading incomplete observation into an unsupported negative claim.
keywords:
  - negative evidence integrity
  - query completeness
  - Model Context Protocol
  - conformance testing
  - AI agents
